# a node the brief lists but the drawing hides (opacity 0) is missing, slot or not
...@mini-theme
grid-rows: 2
grid-columns: 2
classes: {slot: {label: ""; grid-rows: 1; style.opacity: 0}}
t1: {class: slot; x: "09:12" {class: service}}
e1: Alarm fires {class: service}
t2: {class: slot; x: "09:20" {class: service; style.opacity: 0}}
e2: Failover starts {class: service}
e1 -> e2: {class: dep}
